Unless you want to study, you review it, maybe you're going to sit down just to ask me questions.

cue0015513
01:29:04.631 --> 01:29:09.631
That's it. Why? You study more?

cue0015514
01:29:09.631 --> 01:29:11.631
There we did all the minhos.

cue0015515
01:29:11.631 --> 01:29:13.631
There is the next three.

cue0015516
01:29:13.631 --> 01:29:15.631
Tawal sem reha ka.

cue0015517
01:29:15.631 --> 01:29:17.631
But this is it. That's it.

cue0015518
01:29:17.631 --> 01:29:19.631
Ah, sri-lākha-puraṁ.

cue0015519
01:29:19.631 --> 01:29:21.631
That's it.
